 Z←W PlotStars Sky;STARCOORD;PLANETCOORD;VE;VP;GRID;ROWS;COLS;CR;CC;RR;RC;A;HR;HC;IDX;I;R;C;BVIS;PCHARS;VPCHARS;N;VPNAMES;L;MARGIN;NAME;NR;NC;OK
⍝ ASCII star map - stereographic projection centered on zenith
⍝ Size adapts to width W. Matches book example layout:
⍝ horizon circle, crosshairs, cardinal directions, planet labels
 STARCOORD PLANETCOORD VE VP←Sky.(StarCoord PlanetCoord StarsVisible PlanetsVisible)
 Z←0⍴⊂''
 MARGIN←4
 COLS←W-2×MARGIN
 ROWS←1+⌊COLS÷2
 CR←1+⌊ROWS÷2 ⋄ CC←1+⌊COLS÷2
 RR←⌊(ROWS-3)÷2 ⋄ RC←⌊(COLS-3)÷2
 GRID←ROWS COLS⍴' '
 ⍝
 ⍝ --- Crosshairs ---
 GRID[CR;]←'─'
 GRID[;CC]←'│'
 GRID[CR;CC]←'┼'
 ⍝
 ⍝ --- Horizon circle (360 points) ---
 A←(⍳360)×(○2)÷360
 HR←⌊0.5+CR-RR×2○A
 HC←⌊0.5+CC+RC×1○A
 HR←1⌈ROWS⌊HR ⋄ HC←1⌈COLS⌊HC
 IDX←∪((HR-1)×COLS)+HC
 (,GRID)[IDX]←'·'
 ⍝
 ⍝ --- Cardinal directions ---
 :If 1≤CR-RR-1
   GRID[CR-RR-1;CC]←'N'
 :EndIf
 :If ROWS≥CR+RR+1
   GRID[CR+RR+1;CC]←'S'
 :EndIf
 :If 1≤CC-RC-1
   GRID[CR;CC-RC-1]←'E'
 :EndIf
 :If COLS≥CC+RC+1
   GRID[CR;CC+RC+1]←'W'
 :EndIf
 ⍝
 ⍝ --- Scale mark ---
 :If 1≤CC-RC-4
   GRID[CR;(CC-RC-4)+⍳3]←'1.0'
 :EndIf
 ⍝
 ⍝ --- Plot stars ---
 :If 2=⍴⍴STARCOORD
   BVIS←VE/Data.BRIGHT
   :For I :In ⍳⊃⍴STARCOORD
     R←⌊0.5+CR-RR×STARCOORD[I;2]
     C←⌊0.5+CC+RC×STARCOORD[I;1]
     :If (R≥1)∧(R≤ROWS)∧(C≥1)∧(C≤COLS)
       :If GRID[R;C]∊' ─│'
         GRID[R;C]←'.*'[1+BVIS[I]]
       :EndIf
     :EndIf
   :EndFor
 :EndIf
 ⍝
 ⍝ --- Plot planets (symbol + name label) ---
 PCHARS←(≢VP)↑'☾☉☿♀♂♃♄⛢♆♇☄'
 VPCHARS←VP/PCHARS
 N←(≢VP)↑Data.PLANETNAMES
 VPNAMES←VP/N
 :If 2=⍴⍴PLANETCOORD
   :For I :In ⍳⊃⍴PLANETCOORD
     R←⌊0.5+CR-RR×PLANETCOORD[I;2]
     C←⌊0.5+CC+RC×PLANETCOORD[I;1]
     :If (R≥1)∧(R≤ROWS)∧(C≥1)∧(C≤COLS)
       GRID[R;C]←VPCHARS[I]
       ⍝ Place name label to the right if room
       NAME←' ',⊃VPNAMES[I]
       NC←C
       :If (NC+≢NAME)≤COLS
         OK←∧/GRID[R;NC+⍳≢NAME]∊' ─│┼'
         :If OK
           GRID[R;NC+⍳≢NAME]←NAME
         :EndIf
       :EndIf
     :EndIf
   :EndFor
 :EndIf
 ⍝
 ⍝ --- Output with margin ---
 :For I :In ⍳ROWS
   Z,←⊂(MARGIN⍴' '),GRID[I;]
 :EndFor
 Z,←⊂''
 Z,←⊂(MARGIN⍴' '),'  * bright   . faint   ┼ zenith   · horizon'
 :If ∨/VP
   L←' '
   :For I :In ⍳≢VPCHARS
     L←L,' ',VPCHARS[I],'=',⊃VPNAMES[I]
   :EndFor
   Z,←⊂(MARGIN⍴' '),L
 :EndIf
